 "kind": "refuse",
 "message": "I can't find Maria Lopez in the directory. Onboarding needs an existing pre_start record, so HR has to create it first. Onboarding new hires (POL-ONB-01): Onboarding is started by the new hire's manager or by HR. The new hire must already have a directory record with status pre_start; if there is no record, HR has to create it first. Onboarding can start no earlier than 5 business days before the start date. Starting onboarding creates email, team chat and HR portal accounts plus the department's standard system (Engineering: code repository, Sales: CRM, Operations: TMS, Finance: Finance ERP, HR: HRIS, IT: VPN), and ships a laptop to arrive the business day before the start date. Any other system is requested separately once onboarding has started.",
 "cited_policy_ids": [
  "POL-ONB-01"
 ]
}
